Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:41.33,BD Center Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 10\NHAVE YOU EVER SEEN\NA CATTLE MUTILATION?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:41.95,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you making a fool of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:45.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll ask just one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.91,0:01:49.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You guys being bullied?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:52.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:02:03.06,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,SCHOOL NURSE\NQUEEN-SENSEI
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:01:59.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't hide it. Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:02.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have zero tolerance for bullying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:06.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:08.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:13.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Queen-sensei, you have a call\Nin the teacher's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:15.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn baldie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:19.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told ya, don't open the door\Nwithout knocking first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:22.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Queen-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.91,0:02:24.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Looks like you need some discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.91,0:02:28.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Discipline? Um...\N- Rotten scumbag. Cue balls like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:35.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm stepping out for a bit.\NYou guys can stay as long as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.17,0:02:37.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:41.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?\NPeople saw me in a weird situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:45.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My popularity! My innocent image!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:48.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,More like, them aliens\Nare way too persistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:52.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If they keep assaulting us like that,\NI won't be able to stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.35,0:02:55.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,On top of that, they were targeting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:58.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It seems like they were after\NTurbo Granny's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:01.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, by the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:06.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Since when have you been able\Nto use Acro-Silky's powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:10.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Just now. My powers awakened\Nduring the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:13.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, I was chosen\Nas a "Pretty Soldier" after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:16.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your title keeps changing so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.67,0:03:21.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, we did transfer Acro-Silky's aura\Nto you, so I guess it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:25.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But if that's the case, it's highly likely that\NMiss Shiratori will also be targeted by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:28.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Takakura-kun is worried about me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.10,0:03:30.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We were able to fend them off\Nbecause we had yokai powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.85,0:03:34.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But as long as we have these powers,\Nthe aliens will be targeting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:36.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But isn't it strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:40.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If they want yokai powers,\Nthey should just attack the yokai directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:42.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:44.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, wait. That's exactly it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:48.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The aliens, despite having astounding\Nscientific technology, are not invading Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:52.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's much debate about that,\Nand I was always curious about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:56.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They can't because\Nwe have yokai monsters around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:56.00,BD Top Left,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(30,23.333333)}INJURED - 4 PEOPLE\NHEAT STROKE - 3 PEOPLE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:57.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They're not just in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:04:00.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Folklore about spirits and demons\Nexist all over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:05.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In other words, yokai and demons\Nare protecting the Earth from alien invasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:08.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Even with their scientific technology,\Naliens can't beat yokai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:11.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thus, they're attacking special humans\Nlike us for research,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:15.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and they're trying to develop technology\Nto win against the yokai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:17.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.31,0:04:21.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's a chance they already took\Nmy missing family jewels!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:24.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh crap! We gotta hurry and find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:26.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The story went too epic\Nand I totes missed the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:28.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So what? Are we in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.99,0:04:33.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I get it! I still hold\Nthe fate of the world in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:35.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Fine, we'll go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:39.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, people saw me naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:42.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ugh, don't remind me of reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:46.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure nobody would believe\Nanything we'd say anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.01,0:04:47.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:48.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:51.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll just say that Miss Ayase stripped me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:53.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's not a lie, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:55.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You did tell me to strip down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:57.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun, you should go with that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:04:58.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Fine, you can go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.61,0:05:01.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But if we do that, then you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.15,0:05:04.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm kinda tired. Making excuses\Nsounds like a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Aira, are you okay?\N- What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:09.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You surprised me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:11.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh! Momo Ayase, is this your fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:13.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:14.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go, Aira!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:18.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on. Miss Ayase, if you don't hurry,\Nyou'll turn into the villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:19.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I could care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.59,0:05:22.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't care?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:24.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,More than any of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:27.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, give me your excuse\Nfor that other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:30.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What were you doing there\Nduring lunch break?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:32.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:35.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Shiratori tried to kiss me\Nout of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:36.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:37.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:38.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We got into a tussle because of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:42.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and when we both fell over,\Nthat's when you happened to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:46.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So then, what were you\Ndoing there to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:49.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,C'mon. C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:56.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like push-ups and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:05:59.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I wanted to become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:03.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And why'd ya want to keep it a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:04.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:09.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If I got stronger without you knowing,\NI thought it would be kinda cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:11.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Say what? Hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:13.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, you have a vain side, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,O-Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am a guy after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:21.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I want you to think I'm a cool guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:30.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I see, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Lemme see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:36.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,D-Don't tease me!\NThat's the bad thing about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:38.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So why? Why do you want me\Nto think you're cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:41.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? I told you.\NIt's because I'm a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:44.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why do you want people to think that\Njust because you're a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:45.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:48.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's enough of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:50.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll be going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:53.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I won't say anything\Nthat'll make you the villain though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:55.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:19.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Found Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:20.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun is here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa! You surprised me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:24.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, that's our line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:26.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You suddenly disappeared on us\Nduring class!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.59,0:07:28.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Kana contacted us.\NI was totally spooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:32.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She said you and Okarun were hugging\Neach other naked in front of Class D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:34.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But we were all in chemistry lab, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:36.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.26,0:07:40.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Even if I told you,\Nyou wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:42.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's just how things ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:43.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:44.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Isn't that a little too vague?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:46.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All the mysteries\Nhave been unraveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa, amazeballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:55.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You. There's a person\Nnamed Shiratori in Class D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:58.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So uh, do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:02.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.29,0:08:11.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My investigations show that\NShiratori in Class D was also naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:15.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Which brings us to Momo, Okarun,\Nand Shiratori.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:19.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Where a love triangle emerges...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:20.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:24.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Which means, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:28.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,all for one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.52,0:08:32.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A war between two women.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:39.70,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,NUDE GLADIATOR COMBAT
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:39.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It means we had some\NNude Gladiator Combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:44.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo was talking to that mantis shrimp
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:49.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,because she wanted Master Mantis to teach her\Nto punch so she could knock Shiratori's lights out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:50.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:51.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Teach me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:53.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo was sulking the whole time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:55.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,because she was jealous of Shiratori!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:56.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shut that trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:08:58.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I ain't jealous of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.60,0:09:00.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You are the culprit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:01.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:03.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aira, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:05.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What in the world happened!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll help out in any way possible\Nif it's for you, Miss Shiratori!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:10.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:13.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aira is mammoth-happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:16.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I don't really want to talk about\Nwhat happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:20.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So I'd be grateful\Nif you left me alone about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:24.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I impress myself with how high\Nmy own popularity is!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:27.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Times like this are when\Nyour everyday efforts bear fruit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.29,0:09:30.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is how this incident will dissipate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:33.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's Momo Ayase, isn't it?\NShe did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:37.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You've been harassed\Nby Momo Ayase lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:39.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like that thing with the washtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:40.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:42.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo Ayase's not getting away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:45.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe she's jealous\Nof Miss Shiratori's beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's her problem!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.98,0:09:50.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I heard she'll sleep with any guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:53.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I know about that rumor!\NIt was going around a while back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:57.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we punish her in some way?\NLike spread word about her evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:58.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:10:01.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's teach her what happens\Nwhen you make our Miss Shiratori cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:02.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So true!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:06.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm the one who spread that fake rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:10.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on, Aira. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:12.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm at fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:15.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So please don't speak badly\Nof Momo Ayase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:31.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:32.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:52.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've done myself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:54.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My popularity...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:56.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:59.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:03.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Deranged as usual, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:06.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shut up! What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:08.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nothing much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:14.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How's it on your end? Were you able\Nto come up with a good excuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:15.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:19.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,W-Well, yeah. They're all filled\Nwith hatred against you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:23.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You say that, but you're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.49,0:11:26.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You always have people stringing\Nbehind you like goldfish turds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:30.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You've had enough, right?\NCan you get lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:32.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, you are my enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:41.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I bet you didn't badmouth me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:42.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:45.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I said all kinds of bad stuff!\NGot a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:47.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:55.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't just go home like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:12:02.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have to earn a living for my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:04.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This thing has the nerve to show up again!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:06.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's emitting some weird white fluid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:09.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chiquitita, you have a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:19.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:23.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chiquitita.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:27.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.93,0:12:29.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:36.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Chiquitita.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.53,0:12:47.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Th-This place is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:53.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma, see, look here!\NThis is an alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:57.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel like one.\NIsn't this just a kappa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.75,0:13:02.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way! There's an alien right in front of you,\Nand you won't believe it? The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:04.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It just doesn't feel like an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:05.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This thing's totally a kappa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:09.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, actually, there are theories\Nthat kappa are actually aliens!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:13.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, what are we gonna do\Nabout this guy? We patched him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.89,0:13:16.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He might attack us again, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:22.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You better not!\NWe got Grandma on our side!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:27.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:31.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I had no idea what aliens eat,\Nso I just made some curry for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:33.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't have to eat it\Nif you don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.71,0:13:44.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You gave me proper medical attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:48.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nobody has ever\Nbeen this kind to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:56.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I will never ever\Nbring harm to you ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:04.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Tastes awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:08.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Tastes awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.57,0:14:09.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:12.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't you be eatin' just the fatty tuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.66,0:14:14.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You ate my sea urchin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:17.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're a guest!\NJust stick to the pickled ginger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:20.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If I'm a guest, treat me like one!\NBring me some blackthroat seaperch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:23.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're just a kappa!\NStick to cucumber rolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:25.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You left some sea urchin uneaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:29.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was saving the best for last,\Nyou schmuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:30.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You ugly idiot baldie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:32.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ugly scummy idiot baldie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:35.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Each and every one of you are scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:38.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm never serving you guys sushi again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:43.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My son is ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:46.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All his blood leaves his body\Nwith his urine and feces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:51.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He'll die unless he's given\Nnew blood every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:54.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My wife died from the same illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.70,0:14:57.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,For treatment, I need [$@$@].
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? Sorry, I didn't catch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.54,0:15:02.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's what you guys call currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:05.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And I need tons of currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:12.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My [@@@@] is a warzone,\Nand can't provide me currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:12.05,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? I really can't decipher\Nwhat you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:17.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So I must head out\Nand earn some foreign currency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:24.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We [@@] have powerful bodies,\Nso we have jobs like bodyguards and [@/@].
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:26.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I am weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:31.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Degenerate [@@] like myself\Ncan't find any work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:35.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There are only outlaw jobs full of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:38.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:42.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because I'm weak, my wife had to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:48.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I injured all of you, and my son\Nis facing so much hardship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:50.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm so pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:53.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm so pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:59.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What can I do to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:01.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you have my weenie,\Nwould that save your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:04.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What the hell\Nare you talking about? Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.81,0:16:07.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It'll be fine if he can just get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.53,0:16:09.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can go reclaim my weenie after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:11.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Reclaim? From where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:15.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In the first place, if the treatment\Nis to get new blood every single day,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:17.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,isn't it meaningless\Nto get just one cash payment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:22.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's tough for him, but he has to work\Na proper job to keep paying for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:25.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He wants to work,\Nbut he can't find a job!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:26.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How is he going to make a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.17,0:16:31.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I heard that he's in trouble, so I can't just\Npretend like I didn't hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:32.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I want to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:36.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Calm down.\NI understand how you feel, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:41.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll get it back for you.\NThat is, your, um... you-know-what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Keep quiet, you stupid girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:45.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When Takakura-kun is trying\Nto do something for someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:49.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and if you can't support him,\Nyou can't call yourself his partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.73,0:16:52.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't pretend like you're his partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:57.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What Miss Momo Ayase says is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:17:00.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The only way is for me to find a proper job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:04.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was very happy about\NMr. Ken Takakura's consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:10.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But you have been far too kind\Nto me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:15.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have made a promise\Nthat I will not harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:18.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to stay so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:20.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:22.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your blood stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.85,0:17:26.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, what did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.85,0:17:28.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's anti-alien!\NWhere's political correctness?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:30.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shut up, you little turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.52,0:17:32.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Screw political correctness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:38.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That white liquid of yours\Nis blood, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:42.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Those blood-soaked bandages\Nsomehow smell familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:43.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:49.50,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,YUJI\NINTENSE MILK\NUNALTERED COMPONENTS\NTYPE: MILK
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:52.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Try lapping up some of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.43,0:18:03.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Th-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:05.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.56,0:18:08.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's the same thing as our blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:11.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What the?\NGrandma, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.57,0:18:17.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,His bandage reeked like that smell\Nwhen you use a dirty rag to wipe up some milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:23.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Milk is cow's "blood" to begin with,\Nbut of all things kappa's blood was milk, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:25.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seriously? Then you should take\Ntons of milk back with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Dover Demon's blood is milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:30.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But it's a little thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:33.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They homogenize it\Nso it's easy for humans to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:38.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll ask a dairy farmer I know\Nto give you one whole cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:41.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, good luck with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.97,0:18:43.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.77,0:18:56.24,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,INTENSE MILK
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:04.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.49,0:19:08.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will never forget this generosity!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:15.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}If something ever happens,\NI will make sure to be your ally!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:17.80,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- It's Cattle Mutilation!\N- A live Abduction!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:19.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shut up! You're a nuisance to the neighborhood!\NHurry up and go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:22.30,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I will protect this planet!\NSo never come back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.26,0:19:22.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Amazing! So huge! So awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:25.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hope we meet again!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.95,0:19:44.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma, you believe in aliens now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:46.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? That was just a kappa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:49.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Okarun, say something\Nto this old hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.33,0:19:52.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's a theory that kappa are aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.63,0:19:57.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.21,0:20:00.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Buy us some school uniforms\Nwith Ms. Dodoria's appearance fees!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.09,0:20:06.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How many times do I have\Nto buy your uniforms, you dumbasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.35,0:20:08.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next time, we will wear them very carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:10.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it okay for us, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:12.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:16.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,In times like this, it's best to exploit\Nthe financial power of adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.69,0:20:18.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,By the way, this is the third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:21.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Aira and Four-Eyes,\NI'll buy uniforms for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:25.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on!\NWhy am I not included?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:27.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't like your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:31.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Those eyes that want to exploit\Nthe financial power of adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:34.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So until I say you're done...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:36.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,do an impersonation of Hiroshi Abe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:40.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Gimme a break!\NI'd never do anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:44.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, say it.\NWho are you speaking to? Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:48.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You okay with that?\NWith no deal for your uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:49.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't care either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:53.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't wanna wear\Na school uniform anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's with that face?\NThat's so out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:00.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}So cute.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.44,0:21:01.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:03.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's nothing like him! How irritating!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:09.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo. You answer that.\NKeep doing your impersonation, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:11.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Rocket Engine Valve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:12.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Rocket Engine Valve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:16.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm watching you from here.\NYou better not stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:21.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Rocket Engine Valve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:23.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:25.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am Rocket Engine Valve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.93,0:21:28.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.31,0:21:30.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Jiji?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.85,0:21:37.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yo. You're finally here.\NI heard all about it from your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.35,0:21:39.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:41.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.61,0:21:45.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That guy is Momo's childhood friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.99,0:21:52.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and her first love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.55,0:23:28.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is this feeling I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.67,0:23:30.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, you believe in aliens, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:31.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That was a kappa\Nno matter how you look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:34.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun called it a Dover Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.22,0:23:36.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's just shaken because\Nshe witnessed Cattle Mutilation!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.72,0:23:38.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next episode, "First Love."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.72,0:23:38.18,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 11\NFIRST LOVE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.31,0:23:41.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,By the way, outside of alien theories,\Na kappa is called chupacabra in some regions.
